Code: MIT (see LICENSE in this directory).
Lexical data: CC BY-SA 3.0.

The generated lexicon artifacts (dist/lexicon-delta.txt, dist/lexicon-full.txt, the membership
table, and the browser demo bundle that embeds the full lexicon) are derived from the same
permitted corpus as the Java library's resources:

